<title>HUNGARY: Martfu '96 after-tax profit 624.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Martfu '96 after-tax profit 624.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-Dec 1996	Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    595.7	 vs    321.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		729.4	 vs    415.9</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	    624.4	 vs    327.1</p>
<p>    Net sales		   3,629.7	 vs  4,705.1</p>
<p>    Other revenue		 148.2	 vs    166.1</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales   2,162.0	 vs  2,940.5</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales   797.3	 vs  1,380.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  222.8	 vs    228.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 69.8 profit vs   167.9 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	 107.1	 vs    171.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    37.2	 vs	3.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   63.9 profit vs    73.7 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue    70.7	 vs     24.0</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.     6.8	 vs     97.7</p>
<p>    Taxation			105.0	 vs     88.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Elso Magyar Szovetkezeti Sorgyar Rt (Martfu) is a brewery, majority owned by Austria'a Brau Union AG.</p>
<p>The figures were prepared in acccordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
